R_min for Ipk <= 1.33 A at 2 kV contact: 1170 ohm   (charge 0.30 uC = 1.5 x HBM 2 kV charge)
R_min for Ipk <= 1.33 A at 4 kV contact: 2670 ohm   (charge 0.60 uC = 3.0 x HBM 2 kV charge)
R_min for Ipk <= 1.33 A at 6 kV contact: 4170 ohm   (charge 0.90 uC = 4.5 x HBM 2 kV charge)
R_min for Ipk <= 1.33 A at 8 kV contact: 5670 ohm   (charge 1.20 uC = 6.0 x HBM 2 kV charge)

# Self-capacitance of an isolated conductive sphere C = 4*pi*eps0*r (CALCULATION):
  cherry tomato r=1.5 cm   1.7 pF
  apple r=4 cm             4.5 pF
  melon r=8 cm             8.9 pF
  watermelon r=15 cm       16.7 pF
  Human body to earth: 100-200 pF (SOURCE: HBM uses 100 pF; IEC 61000-4-2 uses 150 pF).
  Sweep 10 pF..1000 pF covers object + 1 m wire (ASSUMPTION 30-50 pF/m) untouched and a hand in
  contact (+100..300 pF) with margin; 2000 pF is the MPR121 datasheet upper bound (SOURCE).

# Variant comparison at identical inputs (IEC contact 4 kV and 8 kV, CDC_min = 1 uA, C_ext 10..1000 pF)
variant                                Ipk@4kV   Ipk@8kV   C_add pF  leak/1uA % parts                  single-layer home-etch
a) none                                 15.00A    30.00A        0.0         0.0 n/a                    yes (no parts)
b) series R 3k3 2512 (selected)          1.10A     2.20A        0.0         0.0 RC2512                 yes, as routed (T-091)
b1) series R 3k3 at -1 %                 1.11A     2.22A        0.0         0.0 RC2512                 yes, as routed (T-091)
b') series R 10k                         0.39A     0.77A        0.0         0.0 2512                   yes
c) R 3k3 + TPD4E05U06 x3 to GND          1.10A     2.20A        0.5         1.0 SMD USON-10 2.5x1 mm   no: 0.5 mm pitch vs 0.6 mm clearance rule
d) R 3k3 + 2x1N4148 to 3V3/GND           1.10A     2.20A        8.0         5.0 DO-35 or SOD           partial: 3V3 bus crosses 12 tracks (no bridges on one layer)

